msgstr "Skedar Inner Sanctum has been reached.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_029"
msgid "Skedar secret army has been defeated.\\n"
msgstr "Skedar secret army has been defeated.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_030"
msgid "This seems to be one of the special pillars.\\n"
msgstr "This seems to be one of the special pillars.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_031"
msgid ""
"The power's more constant in this area. \\nThe Inner Sanctum can't be far "
"away.\\n"
msgstr ""
"The power's more constant in this area. \\nThe Inner Sanctum can't be far "
"away.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_032"
msgid "OH, NO!!! A Skedar army in suspended animation!\\n"
msgstr "OH, NO!!! A Skedar army in suspended animation!\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_033"
msgid "Okay, this is it... Cut off the head and the \\nbody will perish.\\n"
msgstr "Okay, this is it... Cut off the head and the \\nbody will perish.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_034"
msgid ""
"This is the Skedar fanatics' most holy place. They believe this planet is "
"sacred ground. The Battle Shrine is located at the most holy part of this "
"holy planet.\\n"
msgstr ""
"This is the Skedar fanatics' most holy place. They believe this planet is "
"sacred ground. The Battle Shrine is located at the most holy part of this "
"holy planet.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_035"
msgid ""
"So let me get this straight - it's holy. But there's more to it than that, "
"isn't there?\\n"
msgstr ""
"So let me get this straight - it's holy. But there's more to it than that, "
"isn't there?\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_036"
msgid ""
"Yes. In all of the time that we Maians fought the Skedar, we never found "
"this place. We knew that until it was destroyed, the war would never be "
"over. We fought the Skedar to a standstill, we earned a ceasefire - but we "
"always had to be on our guard. The destruction of this place would mean a "
"chance at true peace.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Yes. In all of the time that we Maians fought the Skedar, we never found "
"this place. We knew that until it was destroyed, the war would never be "
"over. We fought the Skedar to a standstill, we earned a ceasefire - but we "
"always had to be on our guard. The destruction of this place would mean a "
"chance at true peace.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_037"
msgid ""
"Then we have to be certain that no fanatics survive. I'll go in and take out"
" the leader. You'll have to summon the Maian fleet to level the Shrine.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Then we have to be certain that no fanatics survive. I'll go in and take out"
" the leader. You'll have to summon the Maian fleet to level the Shrine.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_038"
msgid ""
"If you're caught on the ground when the fleet gets here, you won't stand a "
"chance.\\n"
msgstr ""
"If you're caught on the ground when the fleet gets here, you won't stand a "
"chance.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_039"
msgid "That's a mistake I don't intend to make.\\n"
msgstr "That's a mistake I don't intend to make.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_040"
msgid "Yesss...\\n"
msgstr "Yesss...\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_041"
msgid "Joanna! Joanna! \\n"
msgstr "Joanna! Joanna! \\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_042"
msgid "Elvis! Elvis! Over here.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis! Elvis! Over here.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_043"
msgid "No problem. Grab my arms - we'll get you out in no time.\\n"
msgstr "No problem. Grab my arms - we'll get you out in no time.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_044"
msgid "No, quick! Give me your gun!\\n"
msgstr "No, quick! Give me your gun!\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_045"
msgid "Will! You! Just! Let! Go!\\n"
msgstr "Will! You! Just! Let! Go!\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_046"
msgid ""
"I managed to get the fleet to stop the bombardment while I looked for you. "
"They'll start as soon as we're clear.\\n"
msgstr ""
"I managed to get the fleet to stop the bombardment while I looked for you. "
"They'll start as soon as we're clear.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_047"
msgid "I'd have got out in time if that one hadn't grabbed my foot.\\n"
msgstr "I'd have got out in time if that one hadn't grabbed my foot.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_048"
msgid "Of course, Joanna, of course.\\n"
msgstr "Of course, Joanna, of course.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_049"
msgid "No, I would have.\\n"
msgstr "No, I would have.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_050"
msgid "I believe you.\\n"
msgstr "I believe you.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_051"
msgid "Make your sacrifice to the God of War.\\n"
msgstr "Make your sacrifice to the God of War.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_052"
msgid "Grenade ammo used up - can't enter Shrine.\\n"
msgstr "Grenade ammo used up - can't enter Shrine.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_053"
msgid "Alternative entrance to Shrine created.\\n"
msgstr "Alternative entrance to Shrine created.\\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_054"
msgid "Where are you? Are you hurt?\\n"
msgstr "Where are you? Are you hurt?\\n"
